pdf.js 6.3.289

Vendored from the pdfjs-dist npm package so the viewer loads on demand
and the server build needs no extra build-time dependency.

Files: legacy/build/pdf.min.mjs → pdf.min.js, legacy/build/pdf.worker.min.mjs → pdf.worker.js, LICENSE → LICENSE, wasm/, cmaps/, standard_fonts/
Renamed to .js so nginx serves them as JavaScript (it has no mjs mapping).
Regenerate: npm i pdfjs-dist@<version> && npm run sync:pdfjs
